    <title>Scaling Sparse Mixtures of Experts
  to a Trillion Parameters</title>
    <summary>  We scale sparse mixture of experts language models to one trillion parameters with a simple top-2 router
and show that quality keeps improving while the compute per token stays flat. We also study load balancing
losses, expert capacity factors and the effect of the number of experts on downstream fine-tuning quality.
</summary>
